{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1336"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/tv","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__tv.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",704],["-","Stromberg."],["+","Stromberg"],["=",1],["+","and Bjarne Mädel as the hapless clerk Berthold Heisterkamp, known to everyone as \"Ernie\". "],["=",135],["+"," Between those two RTL also tried a lighter family comedy, \"Arme Millionäre\" (2005–2006), co-produced with Austria's ORF, in which Sky du Mont and Andrea Sawatzki played Paul and Adina Gabriel, the parents of a hotel-owning family that suddenly finds itself short of money."],["=",202]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",650],["-","Stromberg."],["+","Stromberg"],["=",1],["+","und Bjarne Mädel als glücklosem Sachbearbeiter Berthold Heisterkamp, den alle nur „Ernie“ nennen. "],["=",133],["+"," Dazwischen versuchte RTL es mit einer leichteren Familienkomödie, „Arme Millionäre“ (2005–2006), koproduziert mit dem österreichischen ORF, in der Sky du Mont und Andrea Sawatzki Paul und Adina Gabriel spielten, die Eltern einer Hoteliersfamilie, die plötzlich in Geldnot gerät."],["=",192]]}]},
